[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186204024 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2da34519-4949-5242-90ca-b17d2dfc3fef"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-2da34519-4949-5242-90ca-b17d2dfc3fef" :question/id #uuid "2da34519-4949-5242-90ca-b17d2dfc3fef" :question/math-academy-id "q-257196" :question/problem "Suppose we wish to find a critical point of the function $f(x,y)$ in the region $[0,2]\\times [0,2]⊆{R}^{2},$ where\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=4{x}^{2}y-2{x}^{2}+xy-3{y}^{2}-2.\n$$\n\nCalculate one iteration of the Newton-Raphson process for optimization that starts at ${x}_{0}=[1,\\,2]^{T}.$ Round your final answer to **three decimal places.**\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"1\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">${x}_{1}≈[$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">$]$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"25\" width=\"25\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "The Newton-Raphson method of optimizing a multivariable function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R$ is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-[{H}_{f}({x}_{n})]^{-1}∇f({x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nwhere $H({x}_{n})$ and $∇f({x}_{n})$ are the Hessian and gradient of $f$, respectively, evaluated at ${x}_{n}.$\n\nIn our case, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(4{x}^{2}y-2{x}^{2}+xy-3{y}^{2}-2) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4{x}^{2}y-2{x}^{2}+xy-3{y}^{2}-2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8xy-4x+y \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+x-6y\\end{bmatrix},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand the Hessian is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}_{f}(x) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(8xy-4x+y) & \\frac{∂}{∂x}(4{x}^{2}+x-6y) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂y}(8xy-4x+y) & \\frac{∂}{∂y}(4{x}^{2}+x-6y)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8y-4 & 8x+1 \\\\ 8x+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our Newton-Raphson formula is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8y-4 & 8x+1 \\\\ 8x+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}8xy-4x+y \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+x-6y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with\n${x}_{0}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={x}_{0}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8y-4 & 8x+1 \\\\ 8x+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{0}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}8xy-4x+y \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+x-6y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8(2)-4 & 8(1)+1 \\\\ 8(1)+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}8(1)(2)-4(1)+2 \\\\ 4(1)^{2}+(1)-6(2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 9 \\\\ 9 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{12\\cdot (-6)-9\\cdot 9}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -9 \\\\ -9 & 12\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{153}\\begin{bmatrix}-21 \\\\ -210\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ≈\\begin{bmatrix}0.863 \\\\ 0.627\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" "answer-field-e8f36341-6eac-5006-97d5-0fb0b1cafe2c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer/id #uuid "e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.863" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e8f36341-6eac-5006-97d5-0fb0b1cafe2c" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8f36341-6eac-5006-97d5-0fb0b1cafe2c" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-dd885b5a-0605-540b-8aed-fbf980d5a010" :answer-field/choices ["answer-dd885b5a-0605-540b-8aed-fbf980d5a010"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd885b5a-0605-540b-8aed-fbf980d5a010" :answer/id #uuid "dd885b5a-0605-540b-8aed-fbf980d5a010" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.627" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-9dfd0945-4d3e-538e-b613-c3c2e6b0d141" :activity/id #uuid "9dfd0945-4d3e-538e-b613-c3c2e6b0d141" :activity/title "Newton's Method for Optimizing Multivariable Functions" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048637 :activity/course 17592186046673 :activity/steps ["step-771bc9ee-acef-593c-92c0-5a668403e45d" "step-a7f21ffd-152a-5b80-9a81-6831dc018252" "step-16446d00-e5b5-5d9b-913d-c5ae0ea22dc7" "step-02f70f84-4879-5483-8c29-2a30eb0b7266" "step-52f3de00-758e-50c2-92d0-b7b2f32051cf"] :activity/first-step "step-771bc9ee-acef-593c-92c0-5a668403e45d" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-771bc9ee-acef-593c-92c0-5a668403e45d" :step/id #uuid "771bc9ee-acef-593c-92c0-5a668403e45d" :step/content 17592186204510 :step/next "step-a7f21ffd-152a-5b80-9a81-6831dc018252" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-a7f21ffd-152a-5b80-9a81-6831dc018252" :step/id #uuid "a7f21ffd-152a-5b80-9a81-6831dc018252" :step/content 17592186204512 :step/next "step-16446d00-e5b5-5d9b-913d-c5ae0ea22dc7" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-16446d00-e5b5-5d9b-913d-c5ae0ea22dc7" :step/id #uuid "16446d00-e5b5-5d9b-913d-c5ae0ea22dc7" :step/content 17592186292591 :step/next "step-02f70f84-4879-5483-8c29-2a30eb0b7266" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-02f70f84-4879-5483-8c29-2a30eb0b7266" :step/id #uuid "02f70f84-4879-5483-8c29-2a30eb0b7266" :step/content 17592186292592 :step/next "step-52f3de00-758e-50c2-92d0-b7b2f32051cf" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-52f3de00-758e-50c2-92d0-b7b2f32051cf" :step/id #uuid "52f3de00-758e-50c2-92d0-b7b2f32051