on formula is\n\n$$\n{x}_{n+1}={x}_{n}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8y-4 & 8x+1 \\\\ 8x+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}8xy-4x+y \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+x-6y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\nStarting with\n${x}_{0}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & ={x}_{0}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8y-4 & 8x+1 \\\\ 8x+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{0}}^{-1}{\\begin{bmatrix}8xy-4x+y \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+x-6y\\end{bmatrix}}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}8(2)-4 & 8(1)+1 \\\\ 8(1)+1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}8(1)(2)-4(1)+2 \\\\ 4(1)^{2}+(1)-6(2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-{\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 9 \\\\ 9 & -6\\end{bmatrix}}^{-1}\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{12\\cdot (-6)-9\\cdot 9}\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -9 \\\\ -9 & 12\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{153}\\begin{bmatrix}-21 \\\\ -210\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ≈\\begin{bmatrix}0.863 \\\\ 0.627\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-2da34519-4949-5242-90ca-b17d2dfc3fef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3"] ["answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer/id #uuid "e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065"] ["answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065" :answer/value "0.863"] ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/correct "answer-e18ea92b-8b23-5b40-aa57-2f8661de8065"] ["answer-field-9722e690-313b-51ec-99a5-45188eea87c3" :answer-field/choices "answer-e18ea92b-8b2